                <strong>Architecture Showcase:</strong> In a live deployment, vehicle telemetry signals are streamed via Azure IoT Hub/MQTT. Machine learning models (e.g., LSTMs) deployed in Azure ML running inference on-device (via ONNX runtime) or in the cloud. Alerts route immediately to the Hospital dispatch dashboard using Azure SignalR WebSockets.
